                            <comment id="16985394" author="ptupitsyn" created="Sat, 30 Nov 2019 16:14:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;After some consideration I&apos;m inclined to remove the method instead of fixing it. The functionality is somewhat niche and can be confusing, let&apos;s not add this to .NET for now.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Additionally, found the same issue with WithAllowAtomicOpsInTx method. It is already released in 2.7.x versions, so marked it &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Obsolete&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; instead of removing.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16985395" author="ptupitsyn" created="Sat, 30 Nov 2019 16:15:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ashapkin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ashapkin&quot;&gt;ashapkin&lt;/a&gt; PR is ready, please review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
